There are a few ways (of which the following list, might, or might not
be complete):
1) as others wrote, reading a blessed scroll of remove curse whitle
confused might do the trick.
2) dipping an object in a fountain sometimes results in a cursing of
the item; the trouble is that there is no message to indicate that
anything happened so you have to keep checking your inventory or you
might end up uncursing it during subsequent dips ("the water glows for
a moment")
3) I think sitting on a fountain can curse items (verify via spoilers,
though)
4) If you don't mind losing your intrinsic protection, you can wear a
helm of opposite alignment and do a water prayer, on a then cross-
aligned altar.

